Package: ramkolfx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme,
 libonnxruntime1.21 | libonnxruntime1.23
Recommends: pipewire, wireplumber
Description: 3D spatial audio, EQ and bass enhancer for PipeWire
 RamkolFX creates a virtual PipeWire sink, processes whatever is played into
 it (HRTF binaural rendering or ambisonics speaker virtualisation, a 10-band
 graphic EQ and a psychoacoustic bass enhancer) and plays the result out
 through a real output device. Includes the ramkolfxd daemon, the
 ramkolfx-gui control app and a bundled set of redistributable HRTFs.
 .
 Enable the daemon with: systemctl --user enable --now ramkolfxd
